# Async & Celery

Push all slow work off the request path (target <500ms API responses):
ticket/invitation delivery, push/email/WhatsApp sends, media transcoding,
redemption logging, trust-score computation, report/Excel exports.

- External calls (gateway, WhatsApp, FCM) must be idempotent + retried with backoff
  + dead-letter handling. Never lose a ticket on a downstream outage.
- Celery Beat schedules: subscription renewal/expiry/1-week-grace/revocation,
  trust-vote window close + weighted-average score update.
- Analytics/report queries run against the read replica.